use /lib

export shape TaskTableTypesShape:
    description:
        Type is a coloured badge with an icon. Reply text is "Reply", errors
        are "Error", a notice from the application about the run, as its
        notices say, is "Notice", and a message sent to the run while it
        works is "Sent". Tool calls are "Files" for Read, Glob, Grep, LS, and
        NotebookRead; "Edit" for Edit, MultiEdit, Write, and NotebookEdit;
        "Command" for Bash, BashOutput, KillShell, and KillBash; "Web" for
        WebFetch and WebSearch; "Agent" for Task and Agent; and "Tool" for
        anything else.
